# artifacts pulled off the box; the mp4s and logs live under runs/ when they are evidence
out/
pull/
*.log
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
ckpts/
rescue/

# CUSTOMER MATERIAL IS NEVER COMMITTED. The prompts every number in PROMPT_IR.md was measured on are
# a customer's shot description, and case/ref2va.jpg is a photograph of a real person. They stay in
# the working copy -- scripts/sync.sh ships whatever it finds in case/ to the pod, so the real files
# reach the GPU without ever reaching a commit -- and only the synthetic case/demo_*.txt stand-ins
# are tracked. Renders of that person, and contact sheets made from them, go to pull/ (ignored above).
case/case.txt
case/case_*.txt
case/*.jpg
case/*.png
!case/demo_*.txt
